# Build context hygiene — keep images small & secrets out.
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.github
**/dist
**/.next
**/report-samples
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local.json
manual.txt
verify-bills-live.log
landing
infra
docs
**/*.md
# …except the agent's skill files: the Rehearsal Lab loads them into the real system prompt.
!packages/orchestrator/skills/**/SKILL.md
**/test
**/*.test.ts
**/vitest.config.ts
.vscode
.idea

# Rehearsal Lab artifacts that never belong in an image
agents-learning/reports
agents-learning/research/results
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
